Review and bug fixing
=====================

* [NOT STARTED] Committer in Training — reproducible, adversarial AI-assisted review of a small, low-risk CommitFest queue; human reviewers retain judgment (Nikolay Samokhvalov, Kirk Wolak)

	https://hacking.postgres.tv/projects/committer-in-training/
	https://github.com/NikolayS/postgres/issues/98

* [NOT STARTED] CommitFest review overlay — source-linked summaries, full review evidence, and PR links addressable by CF patch ID

	https://hacking.postgres.tv/projects/committer-in-training/

* [WIP] Detect standby snapshot corruption (Andrey Borodin)

	https://github.com/NikolayS/postgres/issues/98
